@startuml
title T12-WF11 — AI Sales Meeting Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "Sales UI / Meeting Source" as UI
participant "NestJS Meeting Ingestion API" as API
participant "n8n WF11\nSales Meeting" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS Notification Service" as NOTIFY

UI -> API: Submit meeting transcript/reference + attendees
API -> API: Authenticate requester/source and authorize attendee/CRM scope
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun and store only authorized source reference
DB --> API: workflowRunId
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
API -> N8N: POST protected internal webhook with scoped meeting request
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate meeting ID, transcript and attendee refs
N8N -> N8N: Normalize and redact transcript before AI use
N8N -> API: Save redacted meeting transcript
API -> DB: Insert transcript entity
DB --> API: transcriptId
API --> N8N: transcriptId
N8N -> API: GET attendee Lead/Customer/account context
API -> DB: Read referenced CRM records
DB --> API: Available attendee context
API --> N8N: CRM context + provenance
N8N -> N8N: Build meeting-analysis input
N8N -> AI: Analyze summary, decisions, risks and action items
AI --> N8N: Structured meeting output
N8N -> N8N: Parse/validate schema and flag unsupported commitments
N8N -> API: Save meeting summary linked to transcript
API -> DB: Insert summary entity
DB --> API: summaryId
API --> N8N: summaryId
N8N -> API: Save action items as unconfirmed/pending
API -> DB: Insert meeting action item entities
DB --> API: Action item IDs
API --> N8N: Saved references
N8N -> API: Request owner/attendee notification
API -> NOTIFY: Send in-app notification / approved communication request
NOTIFY --> API: Notification status
API --> N8N: Notification status
N8N -> API: Record final workflow result/output
API -> DB: Update WorkflowRun
DB --> API: Workflow status
API --> N8N: Saved status
deactivate N8N
UI -> API: GET meeting report by workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read meeting/transcript/summary/action refs
DB --> API: Report references
API --> UI: Meeting report and record references
note over API,N8N
The browser/source enters through NestJS. n8n receives only an authenticated internal
request and redacts the transcript before any AI provider call.
end note
@enduml
